# The dist archive of the Composer package phaenon/phn holds the plugin alone
# (design/tooling.md §3.1): composer.json, composer/ and LICENSE. Everything else
# at the root is left out, so a file added there later stays out by default.
# Go builds module zips with these attributes switched off (golang/go#27153), so
# `go install` still gets the whole module.
/* export-ignore
/composer.json -export-ignore
/composer -export-ignore
/LICENSE -export-ignore
